    <string name="settings_hint_dock">How solid the band behind the dock apps is. It shows while the dock is its own row.</string>
    <string name="settings_hint_dock_hidden">How solid the band behind the dock apps is. The current theme hides the band, so this changes nothing until a theme shows it.</string>
