    <string name="settings_hint_accent">The colour of the outline around the selected app and of the dock\'s edge. Kept when the theme changes.</string>
    <string name="settings_hint_clock_style">The clock that appears when Home is left idle: Classic, Big numerals, or Flip cards. The preview shows it; OK tries it full screen.</string>
    <string name="settings_hint_weather">The temperature after the date, for the area your internet connection is in (%1$s). From Open-Meteo, at most every 30 minutes, only while Home or the clock is on screen.</string>
